<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>KuzuOS - Welcome</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            color: #00ff00;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #00ff00;
            background: #0d0d0d;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #00ff00;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3em;
            margin: 0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff00;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #00dd00;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #00ff00;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .ascii-art {
            text-align: center;
            color: #00ff00;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid #00ff00;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .feature {
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .feature::before {
            content: ">";
            color: #00ff00;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        a {
            color: #00ffff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .blink {
            animation: blink 1s step-start infinite;
        }
        @keyframes blink {
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="ascii-art">
            <pre>
    _  __                  ___  ____  
   | |/ /   _ _____  _   / _ \/ ___| 
   | ' / | | |_  / || | | | | \___ \ 
   | . \ |_| |/ /| || | | |_| |___) |
   |_|\_\__,_/___|\_,_|  \___/|____/ 
            </pre>
        </div>
        
        <h1>WELCOME TO KUZUOS<span class="blink">_</span></h1>
        
        <div class="info-box">
            <h2>System Information</h2>
            <div class="feature">OS: KuzuOS v2.0</div>
            <div class="feature">Kernel: Custom x86_64</div>
            <div class="feature">Web Server: httpd/1.0</div>
            <div class="feature">Status: ONLINE</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-box">
            <h2>Features</h2>
            <div class="feature">Custom TCP/IP stack with DNS support</div>
            <div class="feature">HTTP/1.1 with keep-alive connections</div>
            <div class="feature">USB Mass Storage support</div>
            <div class="feature">FAT32 filesystem</div>
            <div class="feature">VGA text mode graphics</div>
            <div class="feature">Network utilities (ping, DNS lookup)</div>
            <div class="feature">Embedded TinyCC compiler</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-box">
            <h2>Available Commands</h2>
            <div class="feature">ping &lt;host&gt; - ICMP echo with DNS resolution</div>
            <div class="feature">httpd - Start this web server</div>
            <div class="feature">ls, cd, cat - File operations</div>
            <div class="feature">tcc - C compiler</div>
            <div class="feature">vim - Text editor</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-box">
            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>
                KuzuOS is a hobby operating system written from scratch. 
                You're viewing this page from a custom HTTP server running 
                entirely in kernel space with a userspace web server.
            </p>
            <p>
                This page is served from the <code>/www/</code> directory 
                on a FAT32 filesystem mounted from USB storage.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #00dd00;">
            <p>Built with ❤️ and assembly</p>
            <p><small>Server time: [System clock not implemented yet]</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
